WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.150
The game starts by asking for the player's name. Blake types his name.

2
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:06.560
The game welcomes Blake and shows the main menu: see rules, play game, or exit. He chooses 1 to see the rules.

3
00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:11.285
Rules: you are 4 years into a sea expedition and need to find your way home.

4
00:00:11.285 --> 00:00:16.010
Each of the 10 cards moves you forward or back. Reach 20 spaces before the cards run out to win.

5
00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:18.500
Back at the main menu, Blake chooses 2 to play the game.

6
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.220
The journey begins.

7
00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:23.700
Card 1: a storm rescue moves the ship forward 12 spaces. Location: 12.

8
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:27.180
Card 2: slow going through icebergs, back 5 spaces. Location: 7.

9
00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:30.660
Card 3: a crew member goes missing, back 4 spaces. Location: 3.

10
00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:34.140
Card 4: dolphins lead the ship to a shortcut, forward 7 spaces. Location: 10.

11
00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:37.620
Card 5: a giant squid attack forces repairs, back 3 spaces. Location: 7.

12
00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:41.100
Card 6: an uncharted island boosts morale, forward 8 spaces. Location: 15.

13
00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:44.580
Card 7: mermaids distract the navigator, back 2 spaces. Location: 13.

14
00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:48.060
Card 8: a sea map in a bottle reveals a current home, forward 10 spaces. Location: 23.

15
00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:51.540
Card 9: the compass holds true through the fog, forward 5 spaces. Location: 28.

16
00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:55.020
Card 10: a virus outbreak delays the journey, back 6 spaces. Location: 22.

17
00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:57.740
Blake finishes at 22 steps, past the 20 needed, and wins the game.

18
00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:03.090
Blake chooses 3 to exit, and the game thanks him for playing.

